            "body": "Sorry for the fuss. I can't reproduce it in a clean setup.\r\n\r\n![apology](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1529a398-9612-447c-95bf-a3fd5ea2da53)\r\n\r\nCan be solved this by changing the key or disabling the `blink.cmp` mapping:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"blink.cmp\").setup({\r\n  keymap = {\r\n    [\"<C-e>\"] = false,\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
